  "description": "Delta Force: Black Hawk Down using the dockerized-game-servers image. Docker image: ghcr.io/sudo-ivan/dockerized-game-servers/delta-force-bhd:latest. Persistent data is stored under /home/container (mapped from the image data directory on startup). Default ports: 3568/udp Requires owned Windows game files copied into the data volume before the server can start.",
